      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَجَّانٌ</span></b>  The <i>stem</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُود</span>) <i>of the raceme of a palmtree:</i> mentioned by ISd; and held by him to be
